{"id":"positive_example_001","chunk_id":"positive_example_001","title":"议程正例：需求评审","content":"先同步用户痛点和版本目标，再逐项评估需求技术可行性，随后确认版本范围、上线时间和风险。正确分类：会议议程，因为描述会议推进顺序与讨论框架。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"requirement_review","dimension":"meeting_agenda","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_002","chunk_id":"positive_example_002","title":"议程正例：项目复盘","content":"先回顾目标完成情况，再分析延期原因，然后讨论改进措施，最后确认下一阶段计划。正确分类：会议议程。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_retrospective","dimension":"meeting_agenda","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_003","chunk_id":"positive_example_003","title":"总结正例：需求取舍","content":"会议围绕V2.2需求范围评审，产品提出三项需求，研发指出推荐功能缺少数据基础。双方据此缩减版本范围，并确认历史数据兼容、上线时间和需求冻结要求。正确分类：会议总结。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"requirement_review","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_004","chunk_id":"positive_example_004","title":"总结正例：进度会议","content":"会议围绕开发进度、接口阻塞和测试准备展开。研发同步核心功能已完成但第三方接口仍延迟，测试提出提前准备回归环境，双方调整联调顺序并明确协作方式。正确分类：会议总结。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_weekly","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_005","chunk_id":"positive_example_005","title":"结论正例：取消需求","content":"会议明确确认V2.2版本不再上线个性化推荐功能，待用户行为数据体系完善后另行排期。正确分类：核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_006","chunk_id":"positive_example_006","title":"结论正例：需求冻结","content":"双方确认需求正式冻结，开发期间不接受临时规则和逻辑变更。正确分类：核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_007","chunk_id":"positive_example_007","title":"结论正例：上线时间","content":"研发说明调整范围后整体周期约20天，参会方明确确认并接受8月3日前上线的节奏。正确分类：核心结论。若只有研发单方估算、未被会议确认，则不得作为核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_008","chunk_id":"positive_example_008","title":"待办正例：补充规则","content":"产品明确表示会将默认标签分组规则和批量下载频率限制阈值补充到需求文档。正确分类：待办与后续安排。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"requirement_review","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_009","chunk_id":"positive_example_009","title":"待办正例：开发实施","content":"研发将在需求定稿后开展接口优化、标签体系重构、历史数据适配和页面优化开发与自测。正确分类：待办与后续安排。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_010","chunk_id":"positive_example_010","title":"待办正例：无截止时间","content":"会议确认运营需要整理用户反馈分类并提交给产品，但未明确截止时间。正确分类仍为待办，deadline 应为空。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_weekly","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_011","chunk_id":"positive_example_011","title":"遗留问题正例：数据体系缺失","content":"当前没有用户浏览、点击、收藏行为数据统计体系，因此无法支撑个性化推荐功能，且会议未给出建设排期。正确分类：遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_012","chunk_id":"positive_example_012","title":"遗留问题正例：外部依赖","content":"第三方接口权限尚未开放，当前没有明确开放时间，也没有替代方案。正确分类：遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"cross_team_coordination","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_013","chunk_id":"positive_example_013","title":"风险正例：数据迁移返工","content":"如果数据迁移过程中临时修改标签规则或下载逻辑，可能导致适配返工并延误上线。正确分类：风险与关注点。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_014","chunk_id":"positive_example_014","title":"风险正例：服务器压力","content":"批量下载如果缺少频率限制，高频请求可能导致服务器压力过大和功能异常。正确分类：风险与关注点。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_015","chunk_id":"positive_example_015","title":"风险正例：交付风险","content":"项目有明确交付日期，关键任务尚无人承接，会议同时指出无人跟进可能导致延期。正确分类：风险与关注点；不得根据任务内容自行指定负责人。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_weekly","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_016","chunk_id":"positive_example_016","title":"风险正例：测试覆盖","content":"上线窗口固定但回归测试时间被压缩，可能导致缺陷遗漏。正确分类：风险与关注点。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"reasoning_pattern_001","chunk_id":"reasoning_pattern_001","title":"推理：数据缺失导致需求阻塞","content":"只有会议原文同时明确功能依赖、依赖条件当前缺失，以及该缺失导致无法推进或需要延期时，才能归纳需求阻塞或暂缓。不得仅凭技术常识补充 blocked、deferred 等状态。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"reasoning_pattern_002","chunk_id":"reasoning_pattern_002","title":"推理：限流缺失导致容量风险","content":"识别容量或稳定性风险时，应有会议证据支持请求规模或高频特征、限制机制缺失，以及潜在影响中的至少两部分；不得仅因出现‘批量下载’就自动推导服务器故障。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"reasoning_pattern_003","chunk_id":"reasoning_pattern_003","title":"推理：规则变更导致返工","content":"识别迁移返工风险时，原文应明确存在迁移或兼容工作、规则或结构可能变化，以及变化会造成重新适配或延期。不得仅凭‘迁移’一词自动生成返工风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"reasoning_pattern_004","chunk_id":"reasoning_pattern_004","title":"推理：固定截止日期但责任人缺失","content":"固定交付日期且关键任务无人承接时，只有会议明确指出无人跟进及其交付影响，才可提取跟进风险；不得自动指定负责人，也不得把所有无负责人的任务都判为风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_weekly","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"technical_incident_boundary_001","chunk_id":"technical_incident_boundary_001","title":"技术故障复盘：根因未确认的分类边界","content":"故障现象已经发生，但具体根因尚未通过日志、监控、复现结果或其他直接证据确认时，应将“根因未确认”记录为遗留问题。排查假设、可能原因和待验证方向不得作为核心结论。只有会议明确确认根因后，才能提取根因结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_incident","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"stage6-approved-v2.1.1","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"technical_incident_boundary_002","chunk_id":"technical_incident_boundary_002","title":"技术故障复盘：止血措施、根因结论与后续待办","content":"增加监控、回滚、限流、重启或继续排查属于止血措施或后续待办，不等于已经确认故障根因。已发生的超时、错误率上升或服务不可用属于故障事实；未来可能再次发生及其影响才属于风险。只有会议明确确认执行某项措施时，该措施才能进入待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_incident","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"stage6-approved-v2.1.1","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_001","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_001","title":"正例：产品研发会议-1","content":"产品说‘我今天补充验收标准并同步研发’，应提取待办：负责人为产品，任务为补充并同步验收标准，deadline 为今天。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"requirement_review","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_002","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_002","title":"正例：电商运营会议-1","content":"客户经理说‘我会整理客户提供的竞品资料和需求清单，今天同步给产品’，应提取待办：负责人为客户经理，任务为整理并同步资料与需求清单，deadline 为今天。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"customer_requirement","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_003","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_003","title":"正例：销售复盘会议-1","content":"客户经理说‘本周五前我把重点客户需求清单发给大家’，应提取待办：负责人为客户经理，deadline 为本周五前。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"customer_requirement","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_004","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_004","title":"正例：市场营销会议-1","content":"管理层明确确认‘下月减少低效渠道预算，将资源转向高优先级项目’，应提取核心结论；只有另有明确执行指派时，才生成相应待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"management_decision","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_005","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_005","title":"正例：客户成功会议-1","content":"原文‘目前没有客户需求优先级评估机制’，且会议未形成建设方案或执行安排，应提取遗留问题，不自动生成‘建立评估机制’待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"customer_requirement","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_006","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_006","title":"正例：供应链会议-1","content":"跨部门会议明确确认‘依赖资料完成后再上线’，可记录为条件性安排；依赖资料尚未完成同时属于遗留问题。不得把条件时间伪造成具体日期。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"cross_team_coordination","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_007","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_007","title":"正例：技术运维会议-1","content":"原文‘如果磁盘使用率继续上涨，可能导致服务不可写’，应提取风险，impact 为服务不可写。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_incident","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_008","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_008","title":"正例：人力资源会议-1","content":"协调人说‘测试团队需要周三前提交回归范围’，负责人是测试团队，不是提出要求的协调人。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"cross_team_coordination","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_009","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_009","title":"正例：财务经营会议-1","content":"原文‘如果回款继续延期，会影响现金流’，应提取风险：回款延期影响现金流。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"management_decision","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_010","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_010","title":"正例：项目管理会议-1","content":"双方说‘需求本周冻结，不再接受临时变更’，应提取核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
